      "keyInsight": "We throw around massive words like \"failure,\" \"respect,\" or \"success\" as if everyone shares the same dictionary. Then we wonder why we fight or feel crushed by self-doubt. Universal definitions force you to open the mystery jar and smell what is inside. If you label yourself a total failure because your souffle collapsed, your definition is wildly broken. Nailing down clear boundaries turns giant, scary monsters into small, solvable tasks.",
